  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet/Chevy Trax ACTIV/LS/LT/RS\nOnly fit carpet floor, not fit vinyl flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats and cargo liner are fit for 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet/Chevy Trax ACTIV/LS/LT/RS, not for vehicles with vinyl floors; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back, Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners\nSafe & Durable: YITAMOTOR floor liners set are made with TPE material, ensures you are safe even in extreme hot weather, contains no latex, cadmium, lead or any harmful PVC’s. High tensity TPE material not only provide great touch feeling and extreme wear-resistance, but also remains flexible under extreme cold weather\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The TPE all weather custom fit floor mats for Chevy Trax 2024-2026 are uniquely designed channels and raised edges that can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The textured skid-resistant surface is easily cleaned. Neither cumbersome vacuum cleaners nor harsh chemicals are needed; simply shake them out or spray them down with a hose\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats for cars are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle",
